PentestIQ — Open-Core License (placeholder)

The core engine, modules, and CLI are intended to be released under a
permissive open-source license (e.g., Apache-2.0). Hosted SaaS features
(multi-tenant console, managed scheduling, team management) are intended to
be offered under a separate commercial license.

